						<strong>(1) Central Intelligence (ten-part audio drama series) </strong><br /><br />
						<strong>
							Fri 13 September 2024 and following days, (times TBD), on BBC Radio 4
						</strong><br /><br />
						Eloise Page ... Kim Cattrall<br />
						Allen Dulles ... Ed Harris<br />
						Richard Helms ... Johnny Flynn<br />
						Frank Wisner ... Geoffrey Arend<br />
						With <strong>Kerry Shale.</strong><br /><br />
						Produced by Goldhawk Productions, Thoroughbred Studios and Rainfall Creations.<br />
						First broadcast on BBC Radio 4 in September 2024.
					</p>
					<p>
						"Kim Cattrall, Ed Harris and Johnny Flynn star in thrilling new audio drama Central Intelligence, coming soon to BBC Radio 4 and BBC Sounds along with other new commissions.<br />
						The ten-part audio drama series, telling the inside story of the CIA, will begin on 13 September 2024 and is part of Radio 4’s popular Limelight podcast feed.<br />
						Central Intelligence is produced by Emma Hearn at Goldhawk Productions Ltd, for BBC Radio 4, where it was co-commissioned by Alison Hindell, Radio 4’s Commissioning Editor for Drama and Fiction and Rhian Roberts, Commissioning Editor for Radio 4 Podcasts, Formats and Digital."
					</p>
					<p>
						More information: <br />
						- Link: <a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/mediacentre/2024/kim-cattrall-ed-harris-johnny-flynn-new-audio-drama-central-intelligence" target="_blank">https://www.bbc.co.uk/mediacentre/2024/kim-cattrall-ed-harris-johnny-flynn-new-audio-drama-central-intelligence</a><br />
					</p>
